				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1499,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Mountain): Add Mermaid sequence diagram for application lifecycle\n\nExpand the `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` file by inserting a Mermaid sequence diagram that visualizes the Mountain startup process. The diagram details the initialization order from `main()`, through `Tauri::Builder` setup, `AppState` creation, and `MountainEnvironment` provider injection, to the spawning of background tasks.\n\nKey stages captured include the initialization of the Echo scheduler (`AppRuntime`), the launch of the gRPC server (Vine), the bootstrap handshake with the Cocoon extension host, and the optional connection to the Air daemon. This addition provides a clear, visual reference for the complex inter-process orchestration defined in the preceding text.",
			"SHA": "064ab84c283122d356b3418ecccd91a17be83326"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-15T22:32:51Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1499,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Mountain): Introduce comprehensive architecture documentation\n\nCreate `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` to serve as the definitive technical reference for the Mountain native backend. This document details the Tauri-based application lifecycle, the implementation of Common traits via the `MountainEnvironment` provider system, and the orchestration of sidecar processes (Cocoon, Air).\n\nThe narrative covers critical subsystems including the gRPC server (Vine) for inter-process communication, the Tauri command registration system, state management via `AppState`, and the process management strategies for extension hosts and background daemons. It also catalogs the IPC event system and caching mechanisms.\n\nThis addition provides necessary context for developers and auditors regarding the Rust backend's structure, effectively replacing scattered code comments with a structured, high-level overview of the editor's native substrate.",
			"SHA": "d4d6944bdecaae78a45ed256e1a6288488f5056d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-15T21:32:29Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1498,
				5
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Standardize debug server environment variables to PascalCase\n\nUpdate the environment variable names for the WKWebView debug server from the uppercase `DEBUG_SERVER` and `DEBUG_SERVER_PORT` to `DebugServer` and `DebugServerPort`, aligning with the project's strict PascalCase naming convention for all configuration keys.\n\nAdditionally, remove the deprecated `DisableUIFixes` key from `Info.plist` and clear the `Trace` configuration value to reduce noise in the release profile. These changes ensure consistent configuration handling across `Info.plist` and Rust source files in `WebkitServer.rs`, `WindowBuild.rs`, and `AppLifecycle.rs`.",
			"SHA": "a6827bb609a1bc2645a40ce6b121231208eab78a"
		},
